          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "p1:b9",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "To sign up for Direct Deposit, the payee is to read the back of this form",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "role": "page-header",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "p1:b10",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "and fill in the information requested in Sections 1 and 2. Then take or",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "role": "page-header",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "p1:b11",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "mail this form to the financial institution.  The financial institution will",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
